    <h3 style="color: #004a99;">Author Guidelines</h3>
    <p>Before submitting, please ensure your manuscript follows these standards:</p>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Originality:</strong> The work must be original and not published elsewhere.</li>
        <li><strong>Format:</strong> Use Times New Roman, 12pt, double-spaced.</li>
        <li><strong>Structure:</strong> Must include an Abstract (250 words max), Keywords (4-6), Introduction, Methodology, Results, Discussion, and Conclusion.</li>
        <li><strong>Referencing:</strong> Follow the APA (7th Edition) citation style.</li>
    </ul>

    <h3 style="color: #004a99;">Submission Checklist</h3>
    <p>As part of the submission process, authors are required to check off their submission's compliance with all of the following items:</p>
    <ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0;">
        <li>✅ The submission file is in Microsoft Word file format.</li>
        <li>✅ Where available, URLs for the references have been provided.</li>
        <li>✅ The text is single-spaced; uses a 12-point font; employs italics, rather than underlining.</li>
    </ul>
